    {
      "title": "How It Works",
      "content": "EnIGMA works by using a <strong>thought-action-observation loop</strong> to execute commands in a Dockerized environment. The agent uses <strong>interactive agent tools (IATs)</strong> to interact with the environment, including a <strong>debugger</strong> and a <strong>remote connection server tool</strong>. The agent also uses <strong>summarizers</strong> to manage long command outputs, allowing it to focus on the most important information.",
