    {
      "title": "The Results",
      "content": "EnIGMA achieves state-of-the-art results on several benchmarks, including NYU CTF, InterCode-CTF, and CyBench. The agent is able to solve <strong>13.5% of NYU CTF challenges</strong> using Claude 3.5 Sonnet, which is more than three times higher than the previous best result. The agent also performs well on CyBench, where it outperforms the previous best result using the same model.",
